exports[`email templates > renders the suspension notice with both parts and a default reason 2`] = `
"Hi Ada,

Your ScholarMarket account has been suspended.

Reason: Violation of ScholarMarket community guidelines or terms of service.

What this means:
- You cannot log in while your account is suspended.
- Your published materials will be unlisted for the duration of the suspension.
- Pending payouts may be placed on hold.

How to appeal:
Reply to this email or contact us at support@scholarmarket.local. Please include your account
email address and a brief explanation if you believe this is an error.

Community guidelines: https://scholarmarket.test/terms


— ScholarMarket Team
© 2026 ScholarMarket"
`;
